        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Manny Cussins\n- Companies: Waring & Gillow, Gillows of Lancaster and London, Waring of Liverpool\n- Topics: Furniture retail, English furniture manufacturing\n\nFacts:\n- Waring & Gillow was formed in 1897 by the merger of Gillows of Lancaster and London and Waring of Liverpool.\n- Waring & Gillow is a noted English furniture manufacturing firm.\n- Manny Cussins was born on 26 October 1905.\n- Manny Cussins was a British businessman who made his fortune in the furniture retail business.\n- Manny Cussins became chairman of Waring & Gillow.\n- Manny Cussins died on 5 October 1987.",
